  "post_content": "<p>El grupo castellonenese Calaverica Rumba Club ha ofrecido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado un extraordinario concierto en el local PaKopes de Tales, con sus canciones propias muy al estilo Pata Negra. La actuaci&oacute;n es la primera de cuatro para esta semana de fiestas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_0648.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El jueves 13 de noviembre, a las 19 horas, ser&aacute; el turno de Bambaniche, junto a Jos&eacute; Jim&eacute;nez, finalista de Operaci&oacute;n Triunfo (OT). Para el viernes, tambi&eacute;n a las 19 horas, est&aacute; prevista una fiesta flamenca con Edgar Gargallo, Cristian Rodr&iacute;guez, Nagore Serrano y Pedrito S&aacute;nchez. La traca final la pondr&aacute; el s&aacute;bado en dos sesiones, una a las 20 horas y otra a medianoche, la Orkesta Pelillo, con sus particulares versiones de temas de punk-rock.&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0642.jpg\" alt=\"img_0642\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0644.jpg\" alt=\"img_0644\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0647.jpg\" alt=\"img_0647\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0648.jpg\" alt=\"img_0648\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0650.jpg\" alt=\"img_0650\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0652.jpg\" alt=\"img_0652\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0653.jpg\" alt=\"img_0653\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0656.jpg\" alt=\"img_0656\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0661.jpg\" alt=\"img_0661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0663.jpg\" alt=\"img_0663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0666.jpg\" alt=\"img_0666\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0667.jpg\" alt=\"img_0667\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0669.jpg\" alt=\"img_0669\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0671.jpg\" alt=\"img_0671\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0673.jpg\" alt=\"img_0673\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcalavericapakopes/img_0678.jpg\" alt=\"img_0678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
